@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Reservation a owl:Class.
hpc:Onetimereservation a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Reservation.
hpc:Recurringreservation a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Reservation.
hpc:User a owl:Class.
hpc:Group a owl:Class.
hpc:System a owl:Class.

hpc:hasreservationid a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:hasuser a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:hasncpus a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:hashosts a owl:ObjectProperty.
